# The 3DS port, the fight in r104 (bench8): commonModelTrans set the vertex format of every model again (GXClearVtxDesc,
# GXSetVtxDesc, GXSetVtxAttrFmt), and the next display list call wrote it to the CP registers (__GXSetVCD, __GXSetVAT,
# __GXCalculateVLim). The format depends on the model's flags and shift only: a model with the key of the one before
# that finds the words that setup left in __GXData leaves its calls out (GXAttr.c re4_gx_vtx_same/keep). The same GX
# state on every draw. RE4_VTX_KEEP=0: the original. A port patch.
